{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_x_044ame_2_1_2_044_22_t01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:12dfdb549b1afc25e663117defaf666b34d7d4b6c2326316f2cee7681ff5c07c",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_x_044ame_2_1_2_044_22_t01:1_2_044_22_t01:cmd-000007:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de8977615cad6fbc851a9e1eb7e29f227183302cd54983ca33f2b6c022e8dc76",
      "text": "喂，●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_044ame_2_1_2_044_22_t01:1_2_044_22_t01:cmd-000009:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e3002b1beda9262ac3ba47717132d70d556952210895690953972d8e0103633e",
      "text": "我看过礼物的内容了。\n送了很不错的东西啊，谢啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_044ame_2_1_2_044_22_t01:1_2_044_22_t01:cmd-000011:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2613d996c200780c08c50fa9f0be13e19e72232447308ebfcf81c75356812ef0",
      "text": "能让您喜欢\n我也很高兴！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_044ame_2_1_2_044_22_t01:1_2_044_22_t01:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a1e86275f1a8b8823fba93d2295703dbb6711e692ff4b584706279fdcadb38a0",
      "text": "嗯。方才的谢意也容我再道一次。\n过了一个很好的生日。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_044ame_2_1_2_044_22_t01:1_2_044_22_t01:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad2f4ee304012610be95ec832c72036e034ba19395f727027ae1633a6bffe407",
      "text": "等到了北村和古论生日的时候，\n我也得借用借用你的力量了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_044ame_2_1_2_044_22_t01:1_2_044_22_t01:cmd-000018:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:26b9ca4c6f8f669486dffc18f71db35ae745685431d0374d3ed9cee1f2ebb036",
      "text": "届时可就全指望你了，制作人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_044ame_2_1_2_044_22_t01:1_2_044_22_t01:cmd-000020:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ccfe3f0d94527b09195d2bb225d65354686e95475940f658fd462af3ce6bd1d4",
      "text": "话说回来，你今晚会弄到很晚才回吗？\n在那之后你又回事务所了吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_044ame_2_1_2_044_22_t01:1_2_044_22_t01:cmd-000022:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b963bd5d36f14a0491cd5dfccf9b79c3eb610e78ee0e8a3abcae449d8d16937e",
      "text": "应该不会\n弄到那么晚的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_044ame_2_1_2_044_22_t01:1_2_044_22_t01:cmd-000025:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a6553aeba5435a725c79fed22f1800501ae959375f91d95b4a4e18bd6f60f31",
      "text": "这样啊。今晚万圣节街上会很吵闹。\n在被卷进去之前，趁早回去比较好哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_044ame_2_1_2_044_22_t01:1_2_044_22_t01:cmd-000027:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07dedbc4b503d448995962ccc1bf09ceda6b6b8771754ba5b67e59d79e4c51ea",
      "text": "毕竟那喧闹的人群之中，说不定会混进真正的那种东西呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_044ame_2_1_2_044_22_t01:1_2_044_22_t01:cmd-000029:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:73574b0ee8967fe76e0ba30823419be0b6686dcbb9170126e3f03abf68883f8d",
      "text": "开玩笑的。但今晚和平常截然不同倒是真的。\n路上小心。回见。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
